    const-string v0, "A dull, deep ache inside (in the bone): stop. It comes from the bone\'s lining where the tissue is thin \u2014 not the effect we want.\n\nCheck: the pads close together (one finger apart); stuck flat, no lifted edges; skin clean, no cream or make-up; pads not worn out.\n\nA sting under one pad\'s edge: the contact \u2014 press or replace the pad.\nA tingle towards the lip, teeth or scalp: the pad is over a nerve \u2014 move it as in the picture.\n\nIf the ache stays at the lowest strength, this area is not for the client today."

